WEBVTT

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:02.427
We know it makes social
and economic sense.

00:07:02.451 --> 00:07:06.806
And when we succeed,
we can all take lungfuls of fresh air.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:09.676
We will be saying hello
to healthy lifestyles

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.789
and resilient economies in livable cities.

00:07:13.559 --> 00:07:17.844
We are all on this journey
around the sun together.

00:07:17.868 --> 00:07:20.340
This is our only home.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:26.150
This is our mission:
to protect our children's future.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.113
Thank you.

00:07:28.847 --> 00:07:30.212
(Lights click off)